+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/consolidate_session.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`
+- Modified `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp_schema_tests/round_trip.rs`
+
+## Verification commands and outputs
+
+### `test -f extension/src/review/promotionQueue.ts`
+
+Result: passed with exit code `0`.
+
+### `test -f extension/src/review/contradictionQueue.ts`
+
+Result: passed with exit code `0`.
+
+### `test -f extension/src/review/components/ProposalDialog.ts`
+
+Result: passed with exit code `0`.
+
+### `cd extension && npm run compile`
+
