Implemented T73 end to end in the review surface: added `promotionQueue.ts`, `contradictionQueue.ts`, and the shared native `<dialog>` flow in `components/ProposalDialog.ts`, plus the missing `StatusBadge` SSOT. I also wired the review panel webview to mount those queue routes and added a provider-side RPC bridge so the webview can list/apply/reject proposals without falling back to placeholders.

Required verification passed:
- `test -f extension/src/review/promotionQueue.ts`
- `test -f extension/src/review/contradictionQueue.ts`
- `test -f extension/src/review/components/ProposalDialog.ts`
- `cd extension && npm run compile`
- `cd extension && npm run lint`

I also ran `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-daemon --lib rpc::mcp_schema_tests::round_trip`, which passed after a narrow response-shape fix for richer promotion proposal data.

The task result is written to [T73.md](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/results/T73.md). I did not run the deploy/restart step because the repo instructions require confirmation before `pkill`/binary copy actions into the installed VS Code extension location.
